<?xml version="1.0"?>
<model>
  <name>MFE Fighter VTOL</name>
  <version>0.1</version>
  <sdf version='1.7'>model.sdf</sdf>

  <author>
    <name>UAV Academy</name>
  </author>

  <description>
    MFE Fighter 2430mm VTOL QuadPlane, for ArduPilot SITL + Gazebo Harmonic.

    FIRST DRAFT (6 Sep 2026) - adapted from ArduPilot's alti_transition_quad
    model. What has actually been changed for the Fighter so far:
      - mass 4.5 -> 10.5 kg, inertia scaled by the same ratio
      - VTOL lift motors remapped to ArduPilotPlugin channels 8-11 to match
        the real aircraft's Fighter_VTOL_V4.6.3.param (Motor1-4 on SERVO9-12)

    NOT yet done (needs the CAD data and/or sim tuning):
      - geometry is still the Alti's (wingspan, motor arm positions, wing
        area). The real Fighter is 2.43 m span / 1.45 m fuselage / 0.725 m2
        wing area.
      - no rudder link/joint yet (the Fighter has one; SERVO4 = Rudder)
      - motor thrust constants, lift/drag coefficients and inertia tensor
        are un-tuned - the model will not fly correctly until these are
        matched against a real flight log.
    See docs/mfe-fighter-sim-model-plan.md and MFE-Fighter-Specifications.md.
  </description>
</model>
